    "detailed_description": "This is a puzzle game where you aim to clear levels by fitting ice blocks into holes.<br />\r\nIt's a simple operation that involves moving blocks on the field up, down, left, or right, but as the level increases, the difficulty becomes more and more challenging.<br />\r\nThe ice block will continue to slide until it hits an obstacle, so it's important to think about how you can stop it at the desired point.<br />\r\nThere is no element of luck or action, so it is recommended for people who simply enjoy solving puzzles.",
